/// Thorns to the player. Mirrors C# `Abrasive.OnPlay`
/// (`decompiled/MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.Cards/Abrasive.cs:33-38`) at
/// pin `v0.103.2`. The card is the only Silent route into Thorns at
/// this pin; once Abrasive resolves, the Thorns listener on
/// `hooks::before_damage_received` is reachable so subsequent enemy
/// attacks reflect `amount` HP-loss back at the attacker (covered by
